      "description": "To mark 25 years of Handel’s London home being open to the public, Hallelujah House: Inside Handel’s HQ explores the music Handel composed and performed whilst calling 25 Brook Street home. Discover how the House was far more than a place to live, uncover the stories behind some of his greatest works and follow the music created within these walls as it travelled across London, from its theatres and taverns to its grandest royal occasions.",
