      "description": "The end of November marks the beginning of the preparations for Christmas feasting! Come as food historians Marc Meltonville and Robert Hoare demonstrate how the Georgians prepared for Christmas Day, the Feast of St. Stephen and the rest of the festive period, including getting their Christmas puddings ready on the last Sunday before advent. The event includes a glass of wine.",
